        "original_id": "e6e59779-2492-513a-8d5a-d58d783c6ad3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: One Magic Christmas, Muppet Treasure Island, Life Begins at Eight-thirty, The Christmas That Almost Wasn't, Trading Places, I'll Be Home for Christmas, Elf\n- People: Phillip Borsos, Robert Louis Stevenson, Monty Woolley, Alberto Rabagliati, Dan Aykroyd, Jan Rubes, David Huddleston, Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Ed Asner\n- Topics: Santa Claus in film\n\nFacts:\n- One Magic Christmas is a 1985 American/Canadian Christmas fantasy film directed by Phillip Borsos.\n- In 1985, Jan Rubes portrayed Santa Claus in One Magic Christmas.\n- Muppet Treasure Island is a 1996 American musical adventure comedy film based on Robert Louis Stevenson's Treasure Island.\n- The topic of Santa Claus in film includes examples of actors who wore the red suit, including Monty Woolley in Life Begins at Eight-thirty, Alberto Rabagliati in The Christmas That Almost Wasn't, Dan Aykroyd in Trading Places, David Huddleston in a 1985 film with an unspecified title here, Jonathan Taylor Thomas in I'll Be Home for Christmas, and Ed Asner in Elf.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
